{
 "(S1) STAMP": "STAMPED @NOW@ by Tuesday @SEAT@. What Tuesday read, and what Tuesday printed at source, is Tuesday's to write here at the stamp; the drafter attests nothing for Tuesday. The drafter read the kit's own pointers by awk NR / grep -n at the pinned shas and the drafter report lists them.",
 "(S2) LAUNCH WINDOW": "From @NOW@ until your hard stop (S5 governs); launch_when_cool, one waiter, load1 below 7 on two reads. The drafter read at 20:12 AEDT (date printed in the same command): load1 3.14 6.39 7.25; live panes tuesday (%0), Datasec/HPSM-POC-D51 (%227), Datasec/HPSM-POC-H120 (%226), fleet-monitor (%1); no Datasec/NexusAI-* pane. Tuesday re-reads before the launch.",
 "(S3) Stamped by": "Tuesday @SEAT@ at @NOW@. The drafter's Q-1 to Q-7 are in the drafter report; their answers are Tuesday's to write here at the stamp.",
 "(S4) Launch authority": "Tuesday @SEAT@ at @NOW@. The drafter was told by Tuesday (relayed, not read at source by the drafter) that this is the round-2 (the cap) gate of the class, G2 with the Opus column, on branch b1278/nexusai-rd924-first-run-input-cell at 6447d6f0928f187d42625927fe6f01434a0ea6eb. The drafter read C-236 at CLARIFICATIONS.md:2508 (the product owner's 2026-11-04 12:37 ruling, 'Land it and ticket the gap'), :2509 (the cap rule C-62) and :2511. The grant under which Tuesday launches, and the yes or no on each of these items, is Tuesday's to write at the stamp: the one in-clone fetch, the fence preload read-and-copy, npm ci in the trees, mutant and plant edits in b1287-probe only, scratch cells and probes on trees the gate built, reads and copies of the previous gate's scripts under session-tools/b1281, harness servers on 127.0.0.1, the gate's own gitleaks run.",
 "(S5) Hard stop and target verdict": "The drafter was told by Tuesday (relayed, not read at source by the drafter): READY/VERDICT by Step-0 date plus 120 minutes, never later than 23:30 AEDT. The gate writes the absolute time from its own Step-0 date; the earlier governs. The drafter did not time a six-boot run or a mutant ticket; the Priority line decides what is not run (the tail mutants MR MF MG MJ MH MFU may be carried from round 1 as RELAYED, named in the STATUS). Tuesday may change the figures and writes the absolute time at the stamp.",
 "(S6) Branch, main and deploy switch at launch": "The drafter read at 20:11-20:14 AEDT (date printed in the same commands; ls-remote on the shared checkout with --no-optional-locks, gh api -X GET under the project GH_CONFIG_DIR): branch 6447d6f0928f187d42625927fe6f01434a0ea6eb (2 commits on main, compare ahead 2 behind 0), main 6e7e94146d77f5127c055d9e922b77bb0f4d9863, refs/heads/b1287*, b1281* and b1284* none, open PRs 0 (control pulls/99999 404), repo variables 0 (control variables/zzqxnonexist 404), organization variables 0, environments dev only, queue-jest empty (ls -A | wc -l 0), free disk 160 GiB. Tuesday re-reads before the launch.",
